  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Quarter Zip Fleece Pullover features a super soft and comfortable polar fleece composition that makes it an ideal jacket or layering piece. This military jacket is ideal for soldiers, tactical professionals, MilSim players, and more.&nbsp;</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "133223",
  "description": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Quarter Zip Fleece Pullover features a super soft and comfortable polar fleece composition that makes it an ideal jacket or layering piece. This military jacket is ideal for soldiers, tactical professionals, MilSim players, and more. Hard-shelled collar and elbow patches enhance durability for a tactical jacket you can wear for years. The pullover features a soft, warm, and comfortable polar fleece composition. Zipper pockets on the left arm and chest of the military jacket for storing EDC (everyday carry) items. A hook and loop patch on the left sleeve is great for mounting flag and morale patches. The military style jacket zips up fully through the collar for all-encompassing neck warmth and features a chin guard.&nbsp;</p>",
